; Blue open-top wastebasket with a bin liner (Sketchfab, Yury Misiyuk, CC-BY,
; 1.1k tris) in place of the primitive cylinder. The model arrives ~370 units
; across, hence the 0.0012 scale; the offset centres it on the body origin, which
; is where the stock CylinderMesh sat.
;
; The open top is load-bearing, not cosmetic: TrashArea has to sit in free space
; over the mouth for get_overlapping_bodies() to catch a released pickable, so a
; lidded bin would silently break drop-to-delete.
[node name="CanMesh" parent="." instance=ExtResource("3_shell")]
transform = Transform3D(0.0011962, 0, 0, 0, 0.0011962, 0, 0, 0, 0.0011962, -0.00736, -0.18172, 0.00047)

